        "title": "policy: preview review-required gateway repairs",
        "body": "## Summary\n\nStacked on #99731 / #99720 / #99700 / #99690 / #99686 / #99121.\n\nAdds review-required `doctor --fix` previews for Gateway policy findings that should not be auto-mutated:\n\n- `policy/gateway-non-loopback-bind`: previews setting `gateway.bind=loopback` for both `gateway.bind` and `gateway.customBindHost` non-loopback findings.\n- `policy/gateway-node-command-denied`: previews appending the missing command to `gateway.nodes.denyCommands`.\n\nThe policy repair handler returns `status: skipped`, leaves config unchanged, and emits preview text through `changes`, `warnings`, and structured config `effects`. The structured repair flow now preserves skipped split-repair `changes` without counting the check as repaired, so review-required previews appear in the same aggregate repair output as automatic repair previews.\n\n## Policy syntax covered\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"gateway\": {\n    \"exposure\": { \"allowNonLoopbackBind\": false },\n    \"nodes\": { \"denyCommands\": [\"system.run\"] }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Evidence collected / findings\n\n- `gateway.bind=\"lan\"` with `allowNonLoopbackBind=false` produces `policy/gateway-non-loopback-bind` and a review-required `gateway.bind=loopback` preview.\n- `gateway.bind=\"custom\"` plus non-loopback `gateway.customBindHost` produces the same preview.\n- Policy `gateway.nodes.denyCommands=[\"system.run\"]` with config missing `system.run` produces `policy/gateway-node-command-denied` and a review-required append preview.\n- All cases keep the original OpenClaw config unchanged and leave the finding present until a reviewed config change is applied.\n- Skipped split repairs now preserve preview `changes` in the aggregate repair result while keeping `checksRepaired=0` and skipping validation.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/flows/doctor-repair-flow.test.ts extensions/policy/src/doctor/register.test.ts --reporter=dot` (10 core repair-flow tests + 293 policy doctor tests passed)\n- `pnpm lint:extensions`\n- `node scripts/run-oxlint.mjs src/flows/doctor-repair-flow.ts src/flows/doctor-repair-flow.test.ts`\n- `pnpm tsgo:extensions`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `codex review --base origin/policy-doctor-gateway-http-repairs`: no actionable correctness issues.\n\n## Notes\n\n- `pnpm tsgo:core` is locally blocked by unrelated untracked `src/oc-path/` files in this worktree (`hasWildcard` / `JsonlLine` unused-symbol errors). Those files are not part of this branch/PR.\n- Broad `pnpm lint:core` timed out locally; targeted oxlint for the touched core repair-flow files passed.",
